    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you’re trying to help but it doesn't change anything. people say things like that just to be nice but i can feel how much everyone actually suffers when i'm around. it's like i'm just dragging everyone down with me. i am so tired of fighting it. it just feels like there's no way out of this loop.",
