      "content": "it's just not that simple. i've tried talking to people and it doesn't work. it just makes things more awkward and then they feel sorry for me which makes it worse. sometimes i feel like if i was just gone, everything would finally be peaceful for everyone. like, wouldn't it be better if the problem just stopped existing?",
